    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Farcela and cavarsela",
     "texto": [
      "**Ce la faccio** (I manage it), **Ce la fai?** (do you manage it?). **Me la cavo** (I get by).",
      "Example: **Me la cavo bene con la lingua** (I get by well with the language)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Realising and regretting",
     "texto": [
      "**Rendersi conto** (to realise): **Mi rendo conto che sei brava** (I realise that you're good). **Pentirsi** (to regret): **Mi pento** (I regret).",
      "Others: **fidarsi** (to trust), **lamentarsi** (to complain)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
